title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.started) {
    Q.next_election_year = window.nextElectionYear(Q);
}
!}

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Resources available: [+ resources +]

Next House election: November [+ next_election_year +]

= The House

218 seats are needed for a majority.

